      "axiomBasis": "0≤p≤|s| for every (s,p)∈Iter(A); p<|s| ⇒ next(s,p)=(Some(s[p]),(s,p+1)); p=|s| ⇒ next(s,p)=(None,(s,p)); remaining(s,p)=drop(p,s)",
      "basisKind": "extensional-structural-definition",
