      "type": "Theorem",
      "name": "operations-well-defined",
      "statement": "Changing integer representatives does not change residue addition or multiplication.",
      "formalStatement": "a≡a′ mod n ∧ b≡b′ mod n ⇒ a+b≡a′+b′ mod n ∧ ab≡a′b′ mod n",
